ft's lease additions metric?","support_fact_ids":["meta-principal","ms-lease-additions"],"expected_answer":"No. Cash principal payments and recognized leased-asset additions measure different events. Similar terminology does not establish comparability.","label_status":"DRAFT_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_ADJUDICATED","model_result":"NOT_RUN"},{"id":"Q07","family":"end_to_end_product","question":"What should a Microsoft research card say about lower reported capex?","support_fact_ids":["ms-guide-old","ms-guide-new"],"expected_answer":"Show the reported amount and measurement-basis change with evidence. Put the underlying-demand conclusion and supplier-revenue inference outside what these numbers establish.","label_status":"DRAFT_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_ADJUDICATED","model_result":"NOT_RUN"},{"id":"Q08","family":"numeric_table","question":"Is Amazon normalized net income equal to net income minus the disclosed pre-tax other-income amount?","support_fact_ids":["amzn-net-income","amzn-other-income-pre-tax"],"expected_answer":"Do not subtract a pre-tax item from after-tax net income and label the result normalized earnings. Tax effects and the approved adjustment definition are missing.","label_status":"DRAFT_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_ADJUDICATED","model_result":"NOT_RUN"},{"id":"Q09","family":"bilingual","question":"Meta是否把2026年资本开支指引的上下限都提高了50亿美元？","support_fact_ids":["meta-guide-old","meta-guide-new"],"expected_answer":"否。下限由1250亿增至1300亿美元，上限仍为1450亿美元。不要将区间中点当作公司预测的期望值。","label_status":"DRAFT_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_ADJUDICATED","model_result":"NOT_RUN"},{"id":"Q10","family":"exact_fact_identifier","question":"Do five disclosures represent five independent institutional forecasts?","support_fact_ids":["ms-guide-old","ms-guide-new","meta-guide-old","meta-guide-new"],"expected_answer":"No. They are five issuer documents from three publisher families. Multiple vintages of one issuer are not independent broker votes.","label_status":"DRAFT_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_ADJUDICATED","model_result":"NOT_RUN"},{"id":